        <mxCell id="gizu-systems-03-48" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Ready is committed only after the saved backup is reopened and verified against the original wallet. Receive Monad USDC at the default account-1 funding address afterward.&#10;Restore needs this encrypted file and the original passkey; it re-encrypts device storage, creates a new journal generation, and keeps Earn reconciliation gated." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#23354B;">
