        <mxCell id="gizu-systems-04-52" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Private keys and raw signing authority stay on the device. Backend receives the signed payloads it relays and holds provider API credentials.&#10;PostgreSQL is not the wallet’s private-key store or operation journal. Chain/provider observations establish settlement; UI completion alone does not." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#23354B;">
