        <mxCell id="gizu-systems-05-50" parent="1" vertex="1" value="There is no generic JavaScript sign-digest API. Native validates owner, chain, contract, amount, nonce, deadlines, fee caps and provider payload before signing.&#10;An interrupted / expired scope needs fresh native review. Signed payloads remain in the encrypted journal; identical-byte retry does not create a second signature." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#23354B;">
