        <mxCell id="gizu-systems-09-41" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Sell: USDG proceeds go directly from the Fusion fill into that leg’s Aurora deposit address. Confirm route credit, then C signs a payout to the corresponding fresh Monad Rᵢ.&#10;Old Aᵢ signs the sale; new Rᵢ receives the return. Each nonempty leg completes sale → route credit → return before the next leg." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#23354B;">
