        <mxCell id="gizu-systems-10-91" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Spending signatures use secp256k1 keys derived inside native Rust. The P-256 passkey assertion grants native authority; PRF only protects backup encryption.&#10;Additional exact family: same-nonce Ethereum cancellation signs a self-transfer after separate approval. Signed-byte retries reuse their signature; genuinely unsigned remaining work needs fresh authorization." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#23354B;">
