        <mxCell id="gizu-systems-11-63" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Recovery of USDG in existing allocated A wallets reuses the permit/order families after fresh review; payout-only buy skips public funding.&#10;Reconcile partial fills, saved orders and intents before continuing. A saved-byte retry does not create a duplicate signature; expired authority or changed terms requires renewed native review." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#23354B;">
