        <mxCell id="gizu-systems-12-38" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Trade analogue: token sell → USDG into Aurora → private USDC → fresh R. Earn analogue: vault redeem → USDC/USDG into Aurora → private USDC → fresh R.&#10;Completion needs verified destination receipts, private credit and investment-role residuals. H is not swept to finish I’s exit. Ethereum can have separate USDC / ETH return children." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#23354B;">
