        <mxCell id="gizu-systems-13-40" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Settled work advances. Unknown outcomes stay locked. Unsigned terms can be refreshed; signed payloads stay immutable. Restore recovers keys, not local operation history.&#10;Cancel stops future signing and releases safe unsigned reservations. It cannot undo submitted funds; same-nonce Ethereum cancellation must reconcile both candidate transaction hashes." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#23354B;">
